"""Type stubs for the simulated VEX IQ 2nd-gen Python API.

These exist so Pylance/IDE autocomplete and signature help work: the real
module builds its enums dynamically at runtime, which type checkers can't
see through. Keep in sync with vex/__init__.py.
"""

